  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EU Support to Food Security in Egypt</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Action seeks to support Egypt in addressing the looming food crisis caused by the Russian war of aggression against Ukraine and the subsequent disruption of the grain (mainly wheat but also maize and sunflower) distribution channels, availability and price on the world market by increasing both the grain production and storage capacities of Egypt.</narrative>
  </description>
